0556   1F                     RAR      ; the carry comes in above the count's sign:
0557   C6 40                  ADI   40h   ;   bit 7 = carry XOR sign
0559   87                     ADD   A   
055A   DA 6E 05               JC   e_heap   
055D   3A 07 00               LDA   0007h   
